  "decision_conditions": [
    "Occupier",
    "The development must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date hereof.\r\rReason: To comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended.",
    "All external facing materials, treatments and finishes shall be similar to those of the original building. Where this is not possible the type and treatment of the materials to be used shall be agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to any above ground works being carried out.  \r\rReason: To ensure that the extension harmonises with the existing building and to ensure compliance with Policies 28 and 30 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.\r",
    "The detached outbuilding shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary and subservient to the residential use of the dwelling at 25 The Drive, Wallington, SM6 9ND, and shall not be used as an independent unit of residential accommodation or for an independent commercial use.\r\rReason: To ensure that the approved development is not used as a separate unit of residential accommodation or for a separate commercial use and in order to protect the amenities of surrounding residential occupiers in accordance with Policies 29 and 34 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The development must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of the 25 The Drive, SM6 9ND  April 2022 by MM PLANNING AND ARCHITECTURAL DRAWINGS, unless otherwise approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: To ensure that the development incorporates the necessary fire safety measures in accordance with the Mayor's London Plan Policy D12.\r"
